D[56788]={"^An instant strike that causes (.-) damage in addition to (.-)%% of your normal weapon damage%. Awards (.-) combo (.-)%.%s*$","Um golpe instantâneo que causa {{1}} de dano além do {{2}}% de seu dano normal de arma. Concede {{3}} ponto de combo {{4}}."}
