D[63005]={"^Increases the damage of |cffffffffBrimstone Bludgeon|r by (.-)%% against |cffff4500Burning|r targets and it now increases the targets chance to be critically struck by (.-)%% for (.-)%.%s*$","Aumenta o dano de |cffffffffClava de Enxofre|r em {{1}}% contra alvos |cffff4500Ardente|r e agora aumenta a chance destes sofram um acerto crítico em {{2}}% durante {{3}}."}
