D[64885]={"^Teaches you the necessary abilities to track monsters%. Tracking a type of monster increases your damage done to it by 1%%%. \n\nTeaches you Track Beasts, Track Demons, Track Dragonkins, Track Elementals, Track Giants, Track Undead%.s:1494:0@~:ext~:ext~:ext~:ext~:ext~:ext@%s*$","Ensina as habilidades necessárias para rastrear monstros. Rastrear um tipo de monstro aumenta seu dano causado a elem 1%.\n\nEnsina Rastrear Feras, Rastrear Demônios, Rastrear Dragóidnes, Rastrear Elementais, Rastrear Gigantes, Rastrear Mortos-vivos. s:1494:0@~: ext~: ext~: ext~: ext~: ext~:"}
D[64886]={"^Teaches you the necessary abilities to track monsters%. Tracking a type of monster increases your damage done to it by 1%%%. \n\n%(Track Beasts, Track Demons, Track Dragonkins, Track Elementals, Track Giants, Track Undead%)%.%s*$","Ensina as habilidades necessárias para rastrear monstros. Rastrear um tipo de monstro aumenta seu dano até elem 1%.\n\n(Rastrear Feras, Rastrear Demônios, Rastrear Draconianos, Rastrear Elementais, Rastrear Gigantes, Rastrear Não-mortos)."}
