D[67446]={"^Instantly attack with both weapons%.  In addition, the next 2 sources of Nature damage dealt to the target are increased by (.-)%%%.  Lasts (.-)%.%s*$","Ataca instantaneamente com as duas armas. Além disso, os próximos 2 origens de dano de Natureza infligidos o alvo aumentam em {{1}}%. Dura {{2}}."}
D[67447]={"^Imbue the Shaman's weapon with wind%.  Each hit has a 20%% chance of granting you (.-) extra (.-) with (.-) extra attack power%.  Lasts for 5 minutes%.%s*$","Influencia a arma do Xamã com vento. Cada golpe tem uma 20% de chance de conceder a você {{1}} extras {{2}} com {{3}} extras poder de ataque. Dura 5 minutos."}
